[11.050082, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u2580\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u2580\u2584\u2580\u2588 \u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u2580\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u2580\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u2580 \u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u2588\u2584\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b[2mv0.7.4\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Provider: anthropic-vertex\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mModel: claude-sonnet-4-5\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mWorking directory: /tmp/ami-demo-K3V2CC\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mSession: session-20261113-145936-465-0\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mPermissions: auto-allow\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Tip: Run \u001b[1m/model\u001b[22m to switch models on the fly.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > Create a file utils.py with a function parse_duration(s) that converts strings like '3h', '45m', \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m'120s' to total seconds (int), but intentionally give it a subtle bug: make it fail on inputs with \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mleading/trailing whitespace and on the bare string '0s'. Then create test_utils.py with edge-case \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mtests that catch those bugs (whitespace, zero values, mixed case like '2H'). Run the tests with \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mpython3 -m pytest test_utils.py -v to show the failures, then fix parse_duration so all edge cases \u001b[3